    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A <ref refid="classmathic_1_1_name_factory" kindref="compound">NameFactory</ref> takes a name and then creates an instance of a class that has been previously registered under that name. This is done in a general way using templates.</para>
<para>None of this is very efficient currently. However, the interface can be implemented much more efficiently if that becomes necessary. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
